## ObjectType: Investment Account

Multi-currency securities custody account belonging to one portfolio; currency denotes reporting currency, not a restriction on instrument denomination.

Local operational extension; no FIBO equivalence asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| account_id | Account Id | string | Stable unique identifier of this business record. | account_id |
| name | Name | string | Human-readable fictional business name with equivalent bilingual meaning. | name |
| portfolio_id | Portfolio Id | string | Foreign key to portfolios; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | portfolio_id |
| currency | Currency | string | Account reporting currency; does not constrain instrument denomination. | currency |

### Keys

Primary Keys: account_id
Display Key: name
